sentences.text:
Accordingly, I pass the following:
ORDER i) The appeal is allowed-in-part;
ii) The judgment and award dated 07.02.2022 passed in MVC.No.2144/2018 by XXIV Additional Small Causes Judge and Motor Accident Claims Tribunal and ACMM (SCCH-26) at Bengaluru is modified;
iii) The claimants would be entitled to a sum of Rs.5,54,264/- as against Rs.2,46,000/-;
iv) The interest awarded by the tribunal at the rate of 9% per annum on the compensation amount of Rs.2,46,000/- is left undisturbed.

The enhanced compensation shall carry interest at the rate of 6% per annum;
v) The enhanced compensation amount shall be paid within four weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this order;
vi) The compensation amount shall be released in favour of the claimant, upon proper identification;
vii) The order of tribunal with regard to pay and recover is retained;
- 10 - NC: 2024:KHC:15811 viii) Registry is directed to transmit the original records to the jurisdictional tribunal forthwith;
ix) All other terms and conditions stipulated by the tribunal shall stand intact.

